WEBVTT

00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:06.000
My name is Taiki Kudou.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.520
I was taken to this mysterious 
place called the Digital World,

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:10.890
where I met Shoutmon

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:13.990
and the other creatures of 
this world, called Digimon.

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:15.820
This world is having a lot of trouble

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:19.600
<b>Team Bagra</b>

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:19.600
<b>Enemy?                              The battle begins!                              Enemy</b>

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:19.600
<b>Team ?                       Team Taiki                    Team Kiriha</b>

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:19.600
Mysterious
Girl

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:19.600
<b>Enemy?                                    Enemy?

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:19.600
Rival

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:19.600
Protagonist

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:18.810
with the attacking Bagra army.

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:22.740
I formed a team with 
Shoutmon and his friends,

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:25.270
and we set out to help Digimon in need.

00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:30.190
A lot of new Digimon friends have joined us,

00:00:30.190 --> 00:00:32.510
but the predicaments and thrills never stop!

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:36.840
The Bagra Army was capturing 
Digimon in the Magma Zone

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:40.950
and forcing them to search for 
its symbol, the Code Crown.

00:00:42.050 --> 00:00:44.090
Our plan to allow ourselves to be captured

00:00:44.090 --> 00:00:46.760
and free them all succeeded,

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:50.460
but then one of the Bagra Army's 
Three Head Officers,

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:52.300
Tactimon, showed up.

00:00:57.070 --> 00:00:59.150
So you managed to escape,

00:00:59.150 --> 00:01:01.540
boy with the red Xros Loader.

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:04.910
Was it you who saved them, Dorulumon?

00:01:04.910 --> 00:01:07.210
You know Dorulumon?

00:01:07.490 --> 00:01:09.460
Let me tell you something interesting.

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:15.140
Dorulumon once overthrew many 
Zones as my right hand man.

00:01:15.650 --> 00:01:16.990
Dorulumon did that?

00:01:16.990 --> 00:01:18.010
What?!

00:01:21.460 --> 00:01:29.970
<b>Dorulumon Runs with the Wind!</b>

00:01:23.210 --> 00:01:25.920
Dorulumon Runs with the Wind!

00:01:29.970 --> 00:01:30.980
You mean...

00:01:31.580 --> 00:01:34.850
He used to be a soldier in the Bagra Army?!

00:01:34.850 --> 00:01:37.360
Not just a soldier.

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:39.640
He was quite a prodigy of a warrior.

00:01:42.680 --> 00:01:47.420
But if you trust him, you will regret it.

00:01:47.890 --> 00:01:49.470
What do you mean?

00:01:49.470 --> 00:01:51.560
The thing he does best

00:01:51.560 --> 00:01:54.830
is make you think he's your friend, 
and then betray you.

00:01:55.130 --> 00:01:58.360
You're lying! Dorulumon isn't like that!

00:01:58.360 --> 00:02:00.130
It's no lie.

00:02:00.130 --> 00:02:05.530
He is a traitor who exposed my 
perfect strategy to our enemy,

00:02:06.050 --> 00:02:09.920
let them escape, and then fled himself.

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:13.220
He is a disgrace to the proud Bagra Army.

00:02:13.780 --> 00:02:16.090
I don't care what you say!

00:02:16.090 --> 00:02:18.380
I trust Dorulumon!

00:02:18.630 --> 00:02:21.150
Then you can disappear with him.

00:02:21.790 --> 00:02:23.920
Jatetsu Fuujinmaru!

00:02:24.630 --> 00:02:25.760
Come!

00:02:44.740 --> 00:02:46.440
Ichi-no-Tachi!

00:03:03.790 --> 00:03:06.610
Shoutmon! Get everyone out of here!

00:03:06.610 --> 00:03:09.800
You think I could run 
away and leave you here?!

00:03:10.110 --> 00:03:12.350
If you stay, you'll all be killed!

00:03:12.350 --> 00:03:13.180
Just go!

00:03:13.180 --> 00:03:14.540
But, Taiki!

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:15.510
Go!

00:03:16.270 --> 00:03:18.730
Dorulu Tornado!

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:40.360
Hurry up and run, Shoutmon!

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:42.060
Fine!

00:03:42.060 --> 00:03:44.150
Okay, guys, we're pulling back for now!

00:03:58.280 --> 00:04:02.450
Without this, you are just an ordinary brat.

00:04:04.470 --> 00:04:06.940
In accordance with Bagra Army law,

00:04:06.940 --> 00:04:11.090
I will give you a most gruesome death.

00:04:11.660 --> 00:04:13.560
Nighthawk!

00:04:25.310 --> 00:04:27.810
Retreat!

00:04:27.810 --> 00:04:29.350
Don't bother chasing them.

00:04:29.350 --> 00:04:31.740
This Zone is already mine.

00:04:32.570 --> 00:04:33.980
Just like you.

00:04:36.740 --> 00:04:38.560
Eavesdropping again?

00:04:38.560 --> 00:04:43.490
Well, I do pick up on some 
rare information that way.

00:04:43.490 --> 00:04:45.250
Did something happen?

00:04:45.250 --> 00:04:48.540
Taiki has fallen into the 
hands of the Bagra Army.

00:04:49.330 --> 00:04:50.700
Taiki?

00:04:50.700 --> 00:04:54.720
It seems Tactimon decided to execute him.

00:04:56.350 --> 00:04:58.340
What are you planning?

00:05:01.050 --> 00:05:03.050
Come on, let me out!

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:08.540
How pitiful.

00:05:08.540 --> 00:05:11.920
My former right hand man,

00:05:11.920 --> 00:05:14.390
placed on display as a criminal.

00:05:14.390 --> 00:05:18.520
Having worked for you is the 
greatest shame of my life.

00:05:18.520 --> 00:05:24.440
And you are the one blotch 
on my perfect battle record.

00:05:24.440 --> 00:05:30.370
Thanks to you, my enemy 
escaped with the Code Crown.

00:05:31.400 --> 00:05:33.540
You had a reason, right?

00:05:34.160 --> 00:05:36.120
It's in the past.

00:05:36.610 --> 00:05:40.650
Does it have to do with why you 
said you prefer being alone

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:42.180
and don't need friends?

00:05:42.180 --> 00:05:44.070
Take it however you want.

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:49.000
The one thing that's certain 
is that I don't need friends.

00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:51.960
Dorulumon...

00:05:53.420 --> 00:05:56.800
AncientVolcamon, prepare for the execution.

00:05:58.500 --> 00:06:01.890
Taiki... I swear I'm gonna save you!

00:06:02.730 --> 00:06:06.810
Still, I can't believe Dorulumon 
was a soldier in the Bagra Army.

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:11.210
Maybe it was Dorulumon who 
attacked Cutemon's village...

00:06:11.210 --> 00:06:14.050
No! I don't want to believe that!

00:06:14.460 --> 00:06:17.710
But if we intend to save him and Taiki,

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:19.710
that Tactimon's gonna be a problem.

00:06:20.420 --> 00:06:24.500
His power in battle is on 
an entirely different level.

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:28.270
Worse, Taiki doesn't have his Xros Loader.

00:06:28.270 --> 00:06:30.370
We can't DigiXros.

00:06:30.370 --> 00:06:34.970
Meramon soldiers, you 
are to attack that cage.

00:06:34.970 --> 00:06:38.480
However, do not finish them immediately.

00:06:38.480 --> 00:06:42.350
Let them suffer slowly 
before ending their lives.

00:06:42.350 --> 00:06:42.980
Yes, sir!

00:06:43.300 --> 00:06:45.720
You mean we're going to be tortured to death?

00:06:45.720 --> 00:06:47.590
Now I've gotta go in there!

00:06:47.590 --> 00:06:49.120
You can't, Brother!

00:06:49.120 --> 00:06:51.150
We can't win without the General!

00:06:51.150 --> 00:06:52.620
But we have no choice.

00:06:54.300 --> 00:06:56.730
Something's coming this way!

00:06:58.070 --> 00:06:59.330
That's...

00:07:00.780 --> 00:07:01.350
Kiriha!

00:07:01.870 --> 00:07:03.170
Plasma Cannon!

00:07:13.540 --> 00:07:14.580
Kiriha!

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:16.410
Attack en masse!

00:07:16.410 --> 00:07:17.120
Yes, sir!

00:07:17.440 --> 00:07:18.780
All troops stand down!

00:07:18.780 --> 00:07:19.470
What?!

00:07:20.260 --> 00:07:23.640
I don't need anyone meddling. 
I'll defeat him.

00:07:24.820 --> 00:07:27.080
Some confidence.

00:07:27.080 --> 00:07:31.500
Is it true that you're the strongest 
fighter of the Three Head Officers?

00:07:31.790 --> 00:07:35.870
You'll find out if you fight me.

00:07:35.870 --> 00:07:37.450
You heard him.

00:07:37.450 --> 00:07:38.690
Interesting.

00:07:38.690 --> 00:07:43.110
I'll defeat you and take all the 
Code Crowns you've collected.

00:07:43.110 --> 00:07:46.280
Fool. That's my line.

00:07:46.280 --> 00:07:47.450
Tanegashima!

00:07:49.810 --> 00:07:51.930
Plasma Cannon!

00:07:57.420 --> 00:07:58.610
Taiki!

00:07:58.610 --> 00:08:00.320
Shoutmon! Everyone!

00:08:00.320 --> 00:08:01.860
We're gonna save you now!

00:08:01.860 --> 00:08:03.250
But we don't have the key.

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:04.330
Leave that to me.

00:08:04.770 --> 00:08:06.730
BlueMeramon? Why?

00:08:06.970 --> 00:08:10.370
I'm here to repay my debt to Dorulumon.

00:08:12.740 --> 00:08:14.490
What does that mean?

00:08:16.070 --> 00:08:18.710
First we've gotta get the Xros Loader back.

00:08:18.710 --> 00:08:22.250
Then your only chance is 
now, while he's fighting.

00:08:22.250 --> 00:08:22.950
This way.

00:08:30.530 --> 00:08:34.200
The monsters born in the 
Digital realm: Digimon.

00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:36.710
They may be made up of data,

00:08:36.710 --> 00:08:41.570
but they're our precious friends 
who cry, laugh, and fight for us.

00:08:41.570 --> 00:08:43.630
Join us in our world of adventure

00:08:44.120 --> 00:08:47.210
as we gather lots more teammates!

00:08:47.210 --> 00:08:48.270
DigiXros!

00:10:28.220 --> 00:10:29.620
Please tell me.

00:10:30.270 --> 00:10:32.780
What happened between Dorulumon 
and the Bagra Army?

00:10:33.190 --> 00:10:35.380
You were right.

00:10:35.380 --> 00:10:38.020
Dorulumon was not a traitor.

00:10:39.750 --> 00:10:43.640
It happened when we were trying

00:10:43.640 --> 00:10:47.240
to overthrow a certain Zone 
by Lord Tactimon's order.

00:10:48.330 --> 00:10:52.080
My platoon met with 
resistance from the locals,

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:54.300
and we were nearly annihilated.

00:10:54.950 --> 00:10:58.120
It was Dorulumon who came to help us.

00:10:58.760 --> 00:11:01.540
BlueMeramon! Retreat now!

00:11:01.540 --> 00:11:02.650
Retreat?

00:11:02.650 --> 00:11:05.790
But we haven't received any 
orders from Lord Tactimon.

00:11:05.790 --> 00:11:10.010
I've received orders to launch 
an attack on this entire area.

00:11:10.010 --> 00:11:12.080
That includes you while 
you're fighting the enemy.

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:13.480
That can't be!

00:11:13.780 --> 00:11:15.790
These are Tactimon's words.

00:11:16.010 --> 00:11:18.790
"If the BlueMeramon die for 
the victory of the Bagra Army,

00:11:18.790 --> 00:11:21.460
that must be what they wish to do."

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:24.340
Get out of here now!

00:11:24.340 --> 00:11:26.630
This place will be a sea of fire soon!

00:11:27.880 --> 00:11:30.000
Everyone retreat!

00:11:30.640 --> 00:11:33.620
But if we flee now and survive,

00:11:33.620 --> 00:11:36.570
we will have acted against 
Lord Tactimon's orders.

00:11:36.570 --> 00:11:40.100
And I'll be court-martialed...

00:11:40.100 --> 00:11:42.750
Just tell them you were following my order.

00:11:42.750 --> 00:11:44.750
But then you'll be...

00:11:44.750 --> 00:11:47.070
Don't worry about me. As it is, I'm...

00:11:47.790 --> 00:11:49.290
Fire!

00:11:58.350 --> 00:11:59.560
Hang in there!

00:11:59.560 --> 00:12:01.780
I... I can't...

00:12:01.780 --> 00:12:02.330
Fool!

00:12:07.100 --> 00:12:09.840
You must live, BlueMeramon!

00:12:11.360 --> 00:12:15.930
The Bagra Army would sacrifice 
its own allies to win.

00:12:15.930 --> 00:12:18.730
I couldn't stand that army anymore.

00:12:18.730 --> 00:12:20.590
I didn't want to go through that again.

00:12:21.030 --> 00:12:24.430
So I left the Bagra Army.

00:12:24.430 --> 00:12:25.890
That was three years ago.

00:12:26.290 --> 00:12:28.130
Three years ago...

00:12:28.130 --> 00:12:32.600
Then it wasn't Dorulumon who 
attacked Cutemon's village?

00:12:32.600 --> 00:12:33.160
No.

00:12:33.160 --> 00:12:34.920
Dorulumon...

00:12:34.920 --> 00:12:37.100
I knew you were a nice guy.

00:12:37.100 --> 00:12:39.820
Dorulumon! I'm sorry!

00:12:39.820 --> 00:12:43.650
I'm sorry I doubted you, 
even if it was just a little!

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:45.640
Forget it.

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:48.210
Maybe he really is a tough guy...

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:49.860
Come on, let's hurry.

00:12:54.490 --> 00:12:56.500
Lord Tactimon!

00:12:58.620 --> 00:13:00.120
He's gone...

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:02.010
Here we are.

00:13:02.670 --> 00:13:05.240
There it is! My Xros Loader!

00:13:06.400 --> 00:13:10.240
Heavy Metal Fire!

00:13:17.710 --> 00:13:19.320
BlueMeramon!

00:13:22.860 --> 00:13:25.520
You traitor!

00:13:26.220 --> 00:13:30.660
Rock Damashi!

00:13:36.490 --> 00:13:38.100
Hang in there!

00:13:38.100 --> 00:13:41.950
I'm glad this life you saved could be of use.

00:13:43.070 --> 00:13:44.870
BlueMeramon!

00:13:52.310 --> 00:13:54.820
Lord AncientVolcamon! Look!

00:13:54.820 --> 00:13:56.810
What?

00:13:57.820 --> 00:14:00.150
Finish them!

00:14:00.150 --> 00:14:02.040
If we don't defeat them,

00:14:02.040 --> 00:14:04.360
there'll never be peace in this Zone.

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:05.370
Yeah.

00:14:05.370 --> 00:14:06.350
Let's go, everyone!

00:14:06.350 --> 00:14:07.500
Right!

00:14:08.090 --> 00:14:09.890
Supernova!

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:11.460
Magma Bomb!

00:14:11.460 --> 00:14:12.880
Counterattack!

00:14:13.190 --> 00:14:15.930
Soul Crusher!

00:14:16.270 --> 00:14:18.720
Heavy Speaker!

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:27.750
Now, Dorulumon!

00:14:28.730 --> 00:14:31.510
Dorulu Tornado!

00:14:38.990 --> 00:14:40.500
Why, you...!

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:45.780
Then you will all become part of me!

00:15:06.990 --> 00:15:09.190
Begone!

00:15:14.130 --> 00:15:17.230
Legendary Digimon, lend us your strength!

00:15:17.240 --> 00:15:19.000
<b>Garurumon</b>

00:15:17.240 --> 00:15:19.000
<b>Attack: Fox Fire</b>

00:15:19.200 --> 00:15:20.630
DigiMemory!

00:15:25.740 --> 00:15:28.090
Fox Fire, activate!

00:15:31.280 --> 00:15:33.040
Garurumon!

00:15:35.610 --> 00:15:37.150
Use Fox Fire!

00:15:45.230 --> 00:15:46.320
I don't need your help.

00:15:46.690 --> 00:15:49.810
Even if it puts our lives on the line,

00:15:49.810 --> 00:15:51.460
we'll risk everything to protect each other.

00:15:51.460 --> 00:15:53.600
That's the kind of friendship 
I want with you!

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:56.270
If we do become friends, 
I might betray you.

00:15:56.610 --> 00:15:59.400
If it's to save a friend, 
you can betray me anytime.

00:16:00.480 --> 00:16:03.540
I've never heard anyone say that before.

00:16:03.540 --> 00:16:05.410
Dorulumon! Taiki!

00:16:05.410 --> 00:16:08.010
Taiki, DigiXros me with Shoutmon!

00:16:08.010 --> 00:16:09.020
Are you sure?

00:16:09.020 --> 00:16:10.210
I'm sure. Do it!

00:16:13.990 --> 00:16:15.220
Shoutmon!

00:16:15.220 --> 00:16:16.350
Dorulumon!

00:16:19.700 --> 00:16:21.370
DigiXros!

00:16:27.660 --> 00:16:29.290
Shoutmon!

00:16:31.140 --> 00:16:32.470
Dorulumon!

00:16:39.000 --> 00:16:40.980
DigiXros!

00:16:41.300 --> 00:16:43.420
Dorulu Cannon!

00:16:46.580 --> 00:16:48.140
Go!

00:16:48.680 --> 00:16:51.340
This is the power of 
Dorulumon and me together!

00:16:54.090 --> 00:16:56.010
Lock on!

00:17:04.200 --> 00:17:05.400
That's it!

00:17:07.170 --> 00:17:08.410
Shoutmon!

00:17:08.410 --> 00:17:09.440
Ballistamon!

00:17:09.440 --> 00:17:10.480
Dorulumon!

00:17:10.480 --> 00:17:11.840
DigiXros!

00:17:15.260 --> 00:17:16.450
Shoutmon!

00:17:18.680 --> 00:17:20.390
Ballistamon!

00:17:22.920 --> 00:17:24.980
Dorulumon!

00:17:32.120 --> 00:17:33.900
DigiXros!

00:17:58.220 --> 00:18:00.790
Shoutmon X3!

00:18:04.230 --> 00:18:06.360
Victorize...

00:18:06.360 --> 00:18:11.740
Super Big Bang Fire!

00:18:09.970 --> 00:18:11.740
Boomerang!

00:18:15.370 --> 00:18:18.070
We are Shoutmon X3.

00:18:18.070 --> 00:18:20.480
Engrave it into your memory one last time!

00:18:25.650 --> 00:18:26.870
All right!

00:18:26.870 --> 00:18:28.390
You're all so amazing!

00:18:39.710 --> 00:18:41.620
Let's go, Greymon!

00:18:46.940 --> 00:18:50.770
So you even have Greymon 
under your command.

00:18:50.770 --> 00:18:52.990
I shall have no shortage of opponents.

00:18:52.990 --> 00:18:53.950
Tanegashima!

00:18:55.880 --> 00:18:57.850
Blaster Tail!

00:19:03.010 --> 00:19:04.890
Kiriha, are you all right?

00:19:04.890 --> 00:19:05.990
Yes.

00:19:05.990 --> 00:19:09.190
But we'll stop here for today.

00:19:11.360 --> 00:19:14.270
Our fight is not over.

00:19:14.270 --> 00:19:17.870
I'm the type who saves 
the fun part for later.

00:19:17.870 --> 00:19:20.040
You sound like a poor loser.

00:19:20.040 --> 00:19:22.170
I could say the same for you. Later.

00:19:26.040 --> 00:19:29.550
So you've finally joined us, huh, Dorulumon?

00:19:29.550 --> 00:19:30.720
Who knows?

00:19:30.720 --> 00:19:32.570
Yeah, yeah, we know you're a tough guy.

00:19:32.570 --> 00:19:34.990
I'm so happy!

00:19:33.920 --> 00:19:36.290
Come on, get off me.

00:19:36.520 --> 00:19:39.710
Dorulumon, Cutemon, we're friends now.

00:19:39.710 --> 00:19:41.630
Let's travel together from now on.

00:19:44.550 --> 00:19:47.670
Well, I guess it's not so bad having friends.

00:19:47.670 --> 00:19:50.550
You're gonna make me cry, tough guy!

00:19:50.550 --> 00:19:54.130
Feels like everyone's strengths 
have come together as one, huh?

00:19:59.510 --> 00:20:00.550
That's...

00:20:00.550 --> 00:20:02.330
The Code Crown!

00:20:03.600 --> 00:20:07.850
All right! The Magma Zone is our turf now!

00:20:07.850 --> 00:20:09.220
Hey!

00:20:13.700 --> 00:20:16.550
Prairiemon and all the others came back!

00:20:24.120 --> 00:20:26.460
Take care of the Magma Zone, okay?

00:20:26.460 --> 00:20:27.840
Just leave it to us.

00:20:27.840 --> 00:20:29.990
We'll work together to protect the Magma Zone

00:20:29.990 --> 00:20:32.710
so the Bagra Army can never attack it again!

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:34.140
We truly thank you.

00:20:34.140 --> 00:20:36.550
By the way, we never got your name.

00:20:36.550 --> 00:20:39.150
Our team's name is Xros Heart.

00:20:39.410 --> 00:20:40.970
Xros Heart...

00:20:40.970 --> 00:20:43.740
If anything happens, 
we'll be here for you in a heartbeat!

